    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1memory_1_1_slab_allocator_1_1_slab" kindref="compound">Slab</ref> Allocator - Fixed-size object allocation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Allocation: O(1)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Deallocation: O(1)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Minimal fragmentation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Best for: Object pools (strings, query contexts, etc.) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
